# Q12 — the same attack as no-creatures.state, except seat 1 (ai) holds ONE
# untapped, non-sick creature able to block. The Declare Blockers window
# should stay open and the block should be assignable. `activephase` lands on
# Declare ATTACKERS, not Declare Blockers — see no-creatures.state's comment
# for why landing straight on Declare Blockers measurably loses the
# characteristics check Forge needs to offer this exact creature as a
# blocker.
